# Build-time settings. Copy to .env.local and fill in; .env.local is gitignored
# (covered by *.local), which is the point: neither value belongs in the repo.
#
# A shell variable of the same name overrides the file, so a Git-connected
# Cloudflare Pages build sets these in the dashboard instead and ignores this.

# The contact address printed on the privacy page, which names Basile Chretien
# as the data controller and is useless without a way to reach him. Use a
# DEDICATED address, never a personal one: it is published, it will be scraped,
# and it is where data-protection requests land, so it wants to outlive any one
# mailbox. A free forwarding alias is enough.
#
# Left unset, the build keeps CONTACT-EMAIL-PLACEHOLDER and warns every run.
# Accounts must not go live in that state.
CONTACT_EMAIL=

# Where the prerendered lesson pages' absolute URLs point. Open Graph rejects
# relative ones, so it is decided at build time. Only set this for a fork or a
# custom domain; the default is https://confoundle.pages.dev
# SITE_ORIGIN=https://confoundle.pages.dev
